        "solutions": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "supportingMedia": [
              {
                "base64": false,
                "type": "text/html",
                "value": "<p>The fix applies CakePHP's h() HTML-encoding function to each sample tag name before it is interpolated into the HTML notice. This ensures that any angle brackets, quotes, or ampersands contained in user-supplied tag names are rendered as inert HTML entities, preventing script execution in the administrator's browser.</p>"
              }
            ],
